"next": "n1",
"text": "愿效劳。"
}, {
"effects": [{
"key": "quest_diao_cha_hei_feng_ling",
"op": "report",
"target": "quest"
}],
"next": "n2",
"text": "我已查明真相。"
}, {
"effects": [],
"next": "n3",
"text": "容我考虑。"
}],
"conditions": {},
"emotion": "忧虑",
"next": "",
"node_id": "n0",
"speaker_id": "char_qin_bo_yuan",
"text": "接连有人在黑风岭失踪，镇民人心惶惶……你既是修士，可愿帮老夫一探？"
}, {
"choices": [],
"conditions": {},
"emotion": "郑重",
"next": "",
"node_id": "n1",
"speaker_id": "char_qin_bo_yuan",
"text": "好！老夫代全镇谢过。岭中妖兽凶戾，务必小心。"
}, {
"choices": [],
"conditions": {},
"emotion": "释然",
"next": "",
"node_id": "n2",
"speaker_id": "char_qin_bo_yuan",
"text": "……竟有此事？妖狼异常、地下冥气……老夫明白了。这点谢礼请务必收下。"
}, {
"choices": [],
"conditions": {},
"emotion": "平静",
"next": "",
"node_id": "n3",
"speaker_id": "char_qin_bo_yuan",
"text": "老夫等你的消息。"
}])
